    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41723" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιψεύδομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lie still more,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				2.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>attribute falsely,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι θεοῖσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.381
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.319
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>falsify</i> a number, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Flam.</u>
				9
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα</span>
			<i>call by a wrong</i> name, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.398
			</span></i> ; <i>feign,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμφοράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					18.6.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>deceive,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				6.46
			</span></i>.</div>
